        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d">This is a *destroyer* attack. Health points lost in excess of a model’s Health characteristic as a result of attacks with this weapon are not discarded, but instead allocated to the next model in the unit.</characteristic>
