    <profile name="Siege Drill" typeId="2857-5ab3-db0f-64a1" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false" id="ad5b-2cbd-ead3-609f">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="e736-f6b3-0474-ddb8">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="9a62-cd45-d844-0bc3">+5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="2780-b560-1641-b9a5">D10</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d">This is a *destroyer* attack, and when rolling to determine the damage characteristic of this weapon, results of 4 or less count as 5.
Each time this weapon inflicts a successful hit on a *vehicle*, *construct*, *monster* or *structure* model, the target model gains a drill point. At the end of the phase, if the target model is not slain, make one attack roll with this weapon for each drill point the target has allocated to it. Damage inflicted by these attacks cannot be allocated to models that do not have drill points allocated to them.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
      <attributes>
        <attribute name="Traits" typeId="8b8e-361d-1bfa-cf66">This is a *destroyer* attack, and when rolling to determine the damage characteristic of this weapon, results of 4 or less count as 5.
Each time this weapon inflicts a successful hit on a *vehicle*, *construct*, *monster* or *structure* model, the target model gains a drill point. At the end of the phase, if the target model is not slain, make one attack roll with this weapon for each drill point the target has allocated to it. Damage inflicted by these attacks cannot be allocated to models that do not have drill points allocated to them.</attribute>
      </attributes>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Heavy Battle Cannon" typeId="f94b-6526-ad27-3051" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="f595-acc0-6461-6938">
