  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Ancient Colossus" id="ac42-c7ab-6f57-a1d7" hidden="false">
      <description>When this unit is shaken, instead of modifying its characteristics as normal, attrition
points are allocated to parts of its body. These effects are cumulative.
Attrition Points | Effects
1 | Crippled Legs: Subtract 1 from this unit’s Speed characteristic.
2 | Cracked Armour: Subtract 1 from this unit’s Defence characteristics.
3 | Blind Eye: Subtract 1 from this unit’s Initiative characteristic.
4 | Deafened: This unit cannot benefit from aura abilities.
5+ | Critical Damage: Each time this unit activates in the Movement Phase, it immediately loses D5 points of health.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="The Ruin of All (D5+5”)" id="7323-bfe2-44d0-6c9d" hidden="false">
      <description>When this unit is destroyed, before removing the model, roll a dice. On a 6+, it explodes in a *blast* attack, with a D5+5” radius originating from its base, with a strength of +3 and a damage of 1. On a natural roll of a 10, or if this unit was destroyed by a *destroyer* weapon, or by losing health to critical damage (see the table above), its explosion has a strength of +5 and a damage of 3.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
